DotRecast — Recast & Detour for .NET
====================================

Vendored from https://github.com/ikpil/DotRecast (local snapshot: D:\Engine\DotRecast).
This tree is an unaltered copy of the six core libraries (Core, Recast, Detour,
Detour.TileCache, Detour.Crowd, Detour.Dynamic). The Recast Demo, Recast.Toolset,
and Detour.Extras projects are intentionally not vendored.

